Question 10: Do MidSem Averages Hide Inconsistency?

AIM: Grouping by subject and computing multiple statistics together.

Code:
import pandas as pd

marks = pd.DataFrame({
    'subject': ['Maths']*4 + ['Physics']*4 + ['Pps']*4,
    'marks': [72, 74, 70, 73, 60, 95, 50, 85, 80, 78, 82, 84]
})

stats = marks.groupby('subject')['marks'].agg(['mean','std','min','max'])
print(stats)

rank_mean = stats['mean'].rank(ascending=False)
rank_std = stats['std'].rank(ascending=False)
print("\nRank by mean:\n", rank_mean)
print("\nRank by std:\n", rank_std)

